---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy — EBS Tunis";
const description = "EBS Tunis privacy policy. Information on the collection, use, and protection of your personal data.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <div class="w-full bg-surface text-ink antialiased">

    {/* ───────────────── HEADER ───────────────── */}
    <section class="bg-navy py-14 md:py-18">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20">
        <nav class="mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-white/40 font-medium">
            <li><a href="/en" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">Home</a></li>
            <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
            <li class="text-white/70">Privacy Policy</li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="font-heading font-bold text-[clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.5rem)] leading-[1.1] text-white">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
      </div>
    </section>


    {/* ───────────────── CONTENT ───────────────── */}
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 prose-legal">

        <p>
          EBS Tunis (Espima Business School) is committed to protecting the privacy of its users. This privacy policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your personal data when you use our website <strong>ebs.tn</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Data Collected</h2>
        <p>We may collect the following data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Identification data:</strong> last name, first name, email address, phone number, provided during online pre-registration or a contact request.</li>
          <li><strong>Academic data:</strong> level of education, desired programme, school documents submitted as part of the admissions process.</li>
          <li><strong>Browsing data:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages visited, visit duration, collected via cookies for statistical purposes.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Processing Purposes</h2>
        <p>Your data is collected for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Processing your pre-registration or contact request</li>
          <li>Communication regarding your admissions file</li>
          <li>Sending information about our programmes (only if you have consented)</li>
          <li>Improving our website and user experience</li>
          <li>Production of anonymous traffic statistics</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
        <p>
          The processing of your data is based on:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Your consent</strong> for collection via the pre-registration form and the use of non-essential cookies.</li>
          <li><strong>The legitimate interest</strong> of EBS Tunis in managing admissions and improving its services.</li>
          <li><strong>Performance of a contract</strong> within the framework of the registration process.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Personal data is retained for the duration necessary for the purposes for which it was collected:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Pre-registration data:</strong> 2 years from the last interaction, unless effective enrollment occurs.</li>
          <li><strong>Enrolled student data:</strong> duration of studies + 5 years after the end of studies.</li>
          <li><strong>Browsing data:</strong> 13 months maximum (analytical cookies).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is never sold to third parties. It may be shared with:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Internal departments of EBS Tunis (admissions, student affairs, management)</li>
          <li>Our university partners (UQAT, EM Normandie, Collège de Paris, Keyce Academy) only as part of a dual-degree programme application, and with your consent</li>
          <li>Technical service providers (hosting, statistical analysis) acting on our behalf</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, modification, disclosure, or destruction. Form submissions are encrypted via HTTPS.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with Organic Law No. 2004-63 of July 27, 2004 on the protection of personal data in Tunisia, you have the following rights:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Right of access:</strong> obtain a copy of your personal data held by EBS Tunis.</li>
          <li><strong>Right of rectification:</strong> correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
          <li><strong>Right of objection:</strong> object to the processing of your data on legitimate grounds.</li>
          <li><strong>Right of deletion:</strong> request the deletion of your data, subject to legal retention obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise these rights, contact us at: <strong>contact@ebs.tn</strong>
        </p>

        <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Our site uses cookies to ensure proper functionality and measure audience:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> necessary for the site to function (no consent required).</li>
          <li><strong>Analytical cookies:</strong> anonymous audience measurement to improve our services (consent required).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You can configure your browser to refuse all or some cookies. Refusing analytical cookies does not affect your browsing experience on the site.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Policy Changes</h2>
        <p>
          EBS Tunis reserves the right to modify this privacy policy. Any changes will be published on this page with the update date.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For any questions regarding this policy or your personal data:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> contact@ebs.tn</li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +216 29 58 28 35</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> EBS Tunis – Espima Business School, Tunis, Tunisia</li>
        </ul>

        <hr />
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">
          Last updated: September 2025
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-legal {
    font-family: var(--font-body, system-ui);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-ink, #1a1a1a);
  }
  .prose-legal h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, system-ui);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-legal p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prose-legal ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prose-legal li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.938rem;
  }
  .prose-legal hr {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e5e5);
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .prose-legal strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
